{"list_html":"  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Groupe_Pharma_3_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"A pharmaceutical group&#039;s fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Several proposals were presented in response to our requirements. One of our key priorities was acoustic performance, and Ronnsquare fully delivered on that challenge, ensuring the level of sound insulation we were looking for&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Office_manager_Groupe_Pharmaceutique_200kb.png\" alt=\"Confidential\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Confidential<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Office Manager \u2013 Pharmaceutical Group<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Merz_Aesthetics_1_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Merz Aesthetics fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We were particularly impressed by Ronnsquare\u2019s ability to propose solutions where all teams would feel at home and genuinely look forward to coming to the office&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nicolas_de_La_Hosseraye_Merz_Aesthetics_200kb.png\" alt=\"Nicolas de La Hosseraye\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Nicolas de La Hosseraye<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Executive Officer \u2013 Merz Aesthetics<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Rodl_200kb-1.jpg\"\n          alt=\"R\u00f6dl &amp; Partner fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;I quickly felt that Ronnsquare truly understood the project: not to disrupt or dismantle what already existed, but to create a more welcoming environment with additional space for employees&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nicola_Lohrey_Rodl_Partner_200kb.png\" alt=\"Nicola Lohrey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Nicola Lohrey<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Managing Partner - R\u00f6dl &amp; Partner<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Vanderlande_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Vanderlande fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;The solutions were quite innovative, and we were particularly impressed by the quality of the materials you proposed&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Christophe_Jallon_Vanderlande.png\" alt=\"Christophe Jallon\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Christophe Jallon<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Executive Officer \u2013 Vanderlande<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Naarea_2_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Naarea fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Thanks to Ronnsquare, we achieved all our objectives, including carrying out the works in an occupied environment, scheduling noisy activities at strategic times, maintaining effective separation between construction areas, and proactively managing outstanding items.&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Jean-Marc-Magnet-Naarea.png\" alt=\"Jean-Marc Magnet\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Jean-Marc Magnet<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Real Estate Director \u2013 Naarea<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_IM_Projet_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"IM Projet fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We had a defined budget, and whenever unexpected challenges arose, Ronnsquare was always available to propose solutions that kept the project within budget. In the end, we delivered the project while fully respecting our financial objectives&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Philippe_Regis_IM_Projet_200kb.png\" alt=\"Philippe R\u00e9gis\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Philippe R\u00e9gis<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">President \u2013 IM Projet<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n","pagination_html":"    <nav class=\"block-11-1-reviews__pagination\" aria-label=\"Testimonials pagination\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--prev\" data-page=\"4\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&larr;<\/span> Previous        <\/button>\n      \n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"1\">1<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__ellipsis\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2026<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"4\">4<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page is-current\" aria-current=\"page\">5<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"6\">6<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__ellipsis\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2026<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"9\">9<\/button>\n              \n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--next\" data-page=\"6\">\n          Next <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;<\/span>\n        <\/button>\n          <\/nav>\n    ","paged":5,"total_pages":9,"total":53}